  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska kyrka and Kristna Freds/SweFor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish church and Kristna Freds/SweFor - Swe church, SweFOR protection programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja och st&#xe4;rka MR-f&#xf6;rsvarares           r&#xe4;ttigheter i en skyddad milj&#xf6; samt att st&#xe4;rka tv&#xe5; lokala             organisationer i provinsen Choc&#xf3; vilka representerar indianska samt   afrocolombianska organisationer i deras kapacitet att kr&#xe4;va och       skydda sina r&#xe4;ttigheter samt att minska deras s&#xe5;rbarhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to promote and strengthen the work of human rights   defenders in a protected environment and to strengthen two local      organizations in the province of Choc&#xf3; representing indigenous and    afrocolombian organizations in their capacity to demand and protect   their rights and decrease their vulnerability.</narrative>
  </description>
